t around well among other cats. He is a good big brother to his youngest son, playing with and bothering him.\n\nYoungest son is a male black cat, short-haired. He is only 5 months old. His eyes are more golden than copper. He has a mischievous personality. He is very fond of the third boy. He plays with them a lot. He is not shy of people at all.\n\nThat's all.\nThe purpose of use is \"I want to love my child.\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/CxqRx3VStnC/?igshid=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kanariraku/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2635607, "client_id": 2671201, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/710861b9/uploads/origins/e3823486-af91-4c18-a153-14d37faae04c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01dcc824ed28e14678a10e2cf172e4c8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/710861b9/uploads/origins/e3823486-af91-4c18-a153-14d37faae04c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01dcc824ed28e14678a10e2cf172e4c8, https://si.imgix.net/710861b9/uploads/origins/e3823486-af91-4c18-a153-14d37faae04c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e57f660fde34d40a0b8753b801fda629 2x, https://si.imgix.net/710861b9/uploads/origins/e3823486-af91-4c18-a153-14d37faae04c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73c26fa5337497f6de5b1ea4af515d77 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/710861b9/uploads/origins/e3823486-af91-4c18-a153-14d37faae04c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bf751423178842fad508cfe72dea108f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/710861b9/uploads/origins/e3823486-af91-4c18-a153-14d37faae04c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr